      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25c-perchlike-fishes-3-remaining-cichlids-from-africa/benitochromis_finleyi_mungo_en/",
      "html": "<p>In respect of water chemistry the species is astonishingly adaptable.</p>"
